          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.163,
            0.12,
            0.885,
            0.188
          ],
          "content": "If they want to show their data through a pictograph, where they also use one symbol for each student, as Lakhanpal did, what are the challenges they might face?"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.163,
            0.191,
            0.885,
            0.257
          ],
          "content": "Jarina made a plan to address this — since there were many students, she decided to use to represent 5 students. She figured that would save time and space too."
        },
        {
